  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tonga ICT Cable Redundancy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity&#xa0;enables&#xa0;New Zealand&apos;s financial contribution towards building&lt;em&gt;&#xa0;&lt;/em&gt;resilience for Tonga&#x2019;s international communications. The activity, led by Australia, seeks to build redundancy and resilience by constructing a second undersea international ICT cable that connects Tonga and the Hawaiki international cable with a landing station at Vava&#x2019;u, Tonga.</narrative>
  </description>
